# The build context of apps/server/Dockerfile is the repository root. Only what
# the build stage reads is sent: manifests, sources, the packaging script and
# the files under docker/ that are copied into the image.

.git
.github/*
!.github/scripts
.claude
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite

# Not part of the server: documentation, the browser tests' output, editor and
# runtime leftovers. The manifests of every workspace package stay, because
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` checks them against the lockfile.
docs
e2e/test-results
e2e/playwright-report
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Never send local configuration, data or secrets to the builder.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.answerwall
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
